   411	    # in ADR-182: scalar `tool_versions.codex_payload_sha256` + scalar
   412	    # `tool_versions.codex_target_triple`); the validator compares it
   413	    # against `payloads[<triple>].sha256` in the manifest. Fail-CLOSED
   414	    # on everything except an unreadable manifest file (infra).
   415	    if args.codex_pin_manifest_file:
